# Agent Instructions

This project is the shared contracts class library of an Intropy integration
system. It holds the contract types that cross component boundaries; sibling
components (extractor, loader) reference it with a `ProjectReference` and
exchange exactly these shapes over pub/sub.

## Project overview

- Framework: .NET 10 class library (no entrypoint, no Dapr)
- Assembly / root namespace: `{{ .name }}`
- Referenced by sibling components as `../{{ .name }}/{{ .name }}.csproj` —
  the folder name, csproj name, and namespace must stay in sync
- Scaffolded once by the first component template that declared it as a
  dependency; later component scaffolds detect `.intropy/scaffold.json` here
  and leave the project untouched

## Important files

- `{{ .name }}.csproj` - the class library project; sibling components point
  their `ProjectReference` at this file.
- `{{ .contract }}.cs` - the canonical order contract the extractor publishes and
  the loader consumes.
- `OrderLine.cs` - the line item record embedded in `{{ .contract }}`.

## Build

```bash
dotnet build
```

There is no Taskfile — the library is built implicitly by every referencing
component's `task build` / `dotnet build`.

## Development notes

- A contract change here fans out to every referencing component on rebuild;
  compile errors in a component after editing this project mean the component
  still maps to the old shape.
